# overlay52Initialize owns overlay 52's .data and .bss, so the compiler
# addresses them through its own section symbols and the static link would
# resolve those to the placed sections.  The shipped overlay keeps each pair
# section-relative (the runtime relocation table supplies the base), so bind
# every site to a zero-valued base placeholder.  Each row asserts offset, old
# symbol and new symbol; only relocation symbol indices change.
